# The Playwright runner never ships.
#
# It is already a separate package with its own manifest, so Vercel's root
# `npm install` cannot pull Chromium into a build that will never launch one.
# Excluding the directory outright is the second line of defence: nothing to
# upload, nothing to trace, nothing to accidentally import from an app file.
runner/

# Recording scripts are for a developer machine and CI, not the serverless build.
record-runs.sh
tests/
